[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=48 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="莫里出现时，你正和一扇门较劲。门把转得动，门却不开。你怕弄坏，不敢再使劲，只好站在走廊里，听着里面一只松动的铁桶来回滚。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="提起来，再往自己这边拽。别跟它讲道理，昨天我已经讲过了，没用。这扇门比我们队长更认死理。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她从你身后伸过手，肩膀往门上一顶。门开了，铁桶立刻撞出来。她用脚跟挡住桶，打量你的湿鞋，又打量你身上那件不合身的外套。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="海里那个？我是莫里。探完路回来，你已经去医务室了。听说你替补给艇画了个漂亮的弯。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="弯画得不算漂亮。后来那一段，我差点忘了拖缆也需要地方。我还想找拉姆森问问，她的舵到底伤成什么样。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="她在船尾。现在别去，她正和一颗螺栓谈心。你要是听见她很温柔，赶紧跑，那颗螺栓马上要没了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她说得很像随口闲聊，手却一直搭在腰边。你侧过身，让出门口。她把脚边的桶踢进储物间，先进去看了一眼，才示意你跟上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿让我找双鞋给你。大的、干的，最好还长得像一双。最后这条有点难，你得提前有个心理准备。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="架上摆着几只布袋，袋口各系一种颜色的线。你伸手去拿蓝色的那只，她马上按住。手背碰到你的时候，她的指尖凉得像刚离开海水。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="那个装擦炮膛的布。鞋在绿袋里。很像吧？上个月德雷顿用蓝袋里的布擦了脸，黑了半天，还说是晒的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="为什么不写字？我不是觉得你们这样不好，只是现在我得问的东西太多，怕耽误大家做事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="写过。泡了一次水，鞋上变成“米”，米袋上只剩个框。后来有个不识字的帮工替我们重分，索性就按颜色了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她翻出两只旧靴，左边的鞋带比右边粗。你坐上木箱，先摸了摸鞋内侧，再把自己的湿鞋脱下来。袜子黏在脚背上，扯到一处破皮。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="疼就慢点。你可以抓着箱沿，又不是非要一口气脱掉。人从海里捞回来，第一天就磨出血，显得我们待客很差。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我不是忍着。我刚才在想，原来我有一双脚，却连自己穿多大的鞋都不知道。这事有点……好笑，又笑不出来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="莫里把另一只靴放下，没有接那句话。她蹲着看了看你的脚，找出一卷窄布，让你先垫住磨破的位置。布卷在她手里绕了两圈，剩下的正好够绑一只鞋口。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="先穿这双。脚趾能动就行，别信鞋底写的号。船厂有个老头修鞋，看不清字，所有四都写成七。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你也穿错过？你说的时候，语气很像已经和那位老头吵过一架。我应该先问你，免得再去和他吵第二架。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="我没有吵。我穿着那双鞋在他门口走了半小时。他最后退了我半块鞋底，还让我以后少去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你忍不住笑，她看了你一眼，眼神终于从你的手移到脸上。走廊外响起一串急促的脚步，德雷顿抱着两只碗经过，鼻尖沾着面粉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="找到了？我就说莫里最会找东西。上次帕金斯丢了账本，她从自己的枕头下面翻出来，省了我们半夜搜船。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="你再把“我借来垫窗缝”这半句省掉，我就告诉他面粉为什么在你脸上。也告诉他你现在抱的哪个碗能喝。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿低头闻了闻左手那只碗，换到右手，又被莫里换回来。最后她们一起看你。你突然不敢接了，两个原本很可靠的人笑得像一伙惯犯。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="这只是糊窗纸的浆，真正的粥在里面。我来拿碗。放心，我没拿吃饭的碗调浆，拉姆森会把我也糊上窗。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="小厨房里只有一张桌子，桌腿用绳子固定在地环上。有人站着吃，有人用膝盖顶住桌沿。莫里把你按在唯一一条空凳上，自己靠着门框。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="碗底有道刻痕的是你的。今天先认这道痕，省得一回头就不知道粥归谁。吃完去后面冲，别倒进窗边的桶。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="蓝桶还是绿桶？我刚学会一套颜色，要是这里又换了规则，你们得再给我一次机会。我不想把第一顿饭也弄坏。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="这里只有铁桶和破铁桶。窗边是接漏水的，里面泡着半截老鼠尾巴。你愿意忘就忘，我反正忘不了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你端着碗，迟迟没有动。不是怕桶。桌边的人已经聊起补给艇的裂口，谁也没等你说一句感谢；可你连这碗热东西该先吹还是先尝，都觉得陌生。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="太烫？我拿勺子给你。昨天有人把我们的勺子全借去敲板了，剩下这一把柄短，你别伸手去捞。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="不是。我可能喜欢咸的，也可能不喜欢。我看见那边的辣酱，知道它会辣，却想不起自己以前会不会加。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿拿起酱罐，又放下。莫里已经从你碗沿分出一小勺粥，滴进去一点酱，推到你手边。勺面红得很浅，看起来没什么威胁。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="尝这个。不好吃就把剩下那碗救住。你不用一下子把以前吃过的饭全想起来，这一口喜欢不喜欢，总能尝出来吧。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把粥送进嘴里，辣意迟了一会儿才追上来。眼睛先热了，鼻子也热。德雷顿一边笑一边找水，莫里伸手把酱罐挪远，自己也有点意外。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="以前喜不喜欢不知道。现在这一口太多了。你刚才说“没有威胁”的表情，我以后最好也记住。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="我没说。是你自己看它长得老实。记住这个教训，港里有些人也是那个颜色，看起来像甜的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把水推给你，自己尝了那勺剩下的粥，脸色也变了。德雷顿笑得差点坐到地上。莫里咳了一声，拧紧罐盖，郑重写了一个很大的“辣”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="这罐有人换过。别看我，我认得出原来那瓶。等我查出来是谁，今晚他的汤里就会有一次很隆重的重逢。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="帕金斯敲了两下门框，说登记室腾出位置了。你下意识站起来，差点带翻凳子。莫里伸脚勾住凳腿，刚才那点笑意又从脸上退下去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="我不去。外侧航灯还得有人接班。德雷顿，他要是路上头晕，你别扶着硬走，找地方让他坐。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="知道。你刚回来也先吃一点，粥给你留在锅边，别再拿辣酱当咸菜。我们尽快回来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_41"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="临出门时，你把湿鞋拎在手里，不知道该扔哪儿。莫里接过去，用鞋带把它们系在栏杆下面，鞋尖朝外，慢慢往海里滴水。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_42"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这双还有用吗？它跟我一起被捞上来的。虽然这么说有点奇怪，但我现在不太想把它扔掉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_43"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="那就不扔。鞋底还能补。你回来自己刷，我可没答应连这件事也替你做。新的别踩浆，刚干。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

